  "section_notes": "The final text sets a 55 °C test with a 5% permanent limit, but explicitly says exceeding it does not automatically prohibit sales, and it keeps per-model results away from the public while giving them to buyers. The S5 recall trigger of 8 per 100,000 is mandatory with no transition, which bears directly on the Ember 8 at 9.9. S3 sets new-unit shut-off at 36 months, which is longer than the 12-month benchmark, though the six-year installed-unit retrofit sits within the acceptable range."
